// Tests of the LAPACKE functions' own work: an invalid matrix_layout (every
// function), NaNs in the arguments and leading dimensions that are too small,
// workspace queries that must not touch the matrices, and what the row-major
// layout copies.
//
// lapacke_checks.inc holds calls and what the reference LAPACKE returned for
// them (generated by compare_lapacke.sh, which also compares much more with
// the reference, by hand). lapacke_functions.inc, generated by CMake, lists
// the functions of lapacke.h.
//
